                "title": "Embellished Leverset",
                "description": "Fit for royalty, this Omnia made door lever features luxurious detailing on the handle and rose. The Embellished Leverset is not for people who want to make a simple statement—it exudes richness that will lend its ornate styling well to fancier home décors. The Embellished Door Lever is available in polished brass and shaded bronze finishes. Choose from dummy, passage, and privacy functions. \r\n",
